    [BugFix][Build] Fix Rust build entrypoint for vLLM 0.31.0 (#18890)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    vLLM v0.31.0 moved the Rust build wrapper from `build_rust.sh` to
    `tools/build_rust.sh`. All eight root Dockerfiles still invoke the old
    path, causing image builds to fail with exit code 127.
    
    - Invoke `bash tools/build_rust.sh` for A2, A3, A5 and 310P on Ubuntu
    and openEuler.
    - Install `requirements/build/rust.txt` from the checked-out vLLM source
    so the standalone build has the upstream setuptools, setuptools-scm,
    setuptools-rust and wheel requirements. The earlier isolated pip build
    does not guarantee these are installed in the runtime Python
    environment.
    - Retain upstream toolchain provisioning and release-mode Rust builds.
    
    Observed failure:
    https://github.com/nv-action/vllm-benchmarks/actions/runs/38714931769/job/116355404362
    
    Upstream references:
    - https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/v0.31.0/tools/build_rust.sh
    -
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/v0.31.0/requirements/build/rust.txt
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Restores image builds using vLLM v0.31.0. No serving API or
    configuration changes.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - Checked all eight root Dockerfiles for the new build entrypoint and
    upstream Rust requirements; no root-level `./build_rust.sh` calls
    remain.
    - `git diff --check` passed.
    - Verified the wrapper and requirements exist in upstream v0.31.0 and
    the wrapper also exists on current main.
    - Attempted `bash format.sh ci`; it could not run because pre-commit is
    not installed locally.
    - Full image-build regression validation will run via the `image-build`
    label. Docker and NPU runtime validation are unavailable on this Windows
    host. No Python unit tests were added because this change only updates
    Docker build commands.
    
    AI assistance was used to inspect the failure, prepare the fix and
    submit this PR.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c4df37dfcc7f72ca41cd43801a468526ecf99a2b
    
    Signed-off-by: zhao-stack <80399320+zhao-stack@users.noreply.github.com>

diff --git a/Dockerfile b/Dockerfile
index 65b85bd9f..3ea11400d 100644
--- a/Dockerfile
+++ b/Dockerfile
@@ -134,8 +134,8 @@ RUN ARCH=${TARGETPLATFORM:-$(uname -m)}; \
 ENV PATH="/root/.cargo/bin:$PATH"
 RUN cd /vllm-workspace/vllm && \
     export PROTOC_INCLUDE=/usr/include && \
-    python3 -m pip install setuptools-rust && \
-    ./build_rust.sh
+    python3 -m pip install -r requirements/build/rust.txt && \
+    bash tools/build_rust.sh
 
 # Append `libascend_hal.so` path (devlib) to LD_LIBRARY_PATH
 RUN echo "export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$LD_LIBRARY_PATH:/usr/local/lib" >> ~/.bashrc
